sequenceDiagram
  actor Staff as Research Staff
  actor PI as Researcher
  participant UI as staff-calls.html
  participant CS as Call service (RGMS.CALLS)
  participant PN as proposal-new.html
  Staff->>UI: Click "สร้างรอบทุนใหม่" (tier cap 100k/200k/300k, deadline)
  UI->>CS: validate fiscal year, dates (close after open), cap
  CS-->>UI: created, status = upcoming
  Staff->>UI: Click "เปิดรับ"
  UI->>CS: setCallStatus(open), close any other open call
  CS-->>UI: status = Open (published)
  PI->>PN: Open new proposal
  PN->>CS: openCall()
  alt call Open and before deadline
    CS-->>PN: call
    PN-->>PI: form enabled
  else deadline passed or closed
    CS-->>PN: null
    PN-->>PI: "Call Closed" notice, submit blocked
  end
